+/** DeltaTor extension: true for the measured-throughput selection policies
+ * (4 = weighted spread by measured throughput, 5 = pure exploit of the fastest
+ * measured set). Both ignore the ConfluxSetRttMax/ConfluxSetRttPct filters so
+ * every acceptable set keeps being measured and can become the fastest. */
+static bool
+conflux_policy_is_measured(int policy)
